          "title": "포천 힐스 컨트리 클럽 예약 - 포천 대한민국 골프 예약",
          "url": "https://www.tigerbooking.com/kr/golf-course/Fortune-Hills-Country-Club-TAKR0131",
          "content": "9,593 meter /  27 Holes /  Par 108\n\n### Services and Amenities\n\nShower\n\nClubhouse\n\nBanquet hall\n\nDriving Range\n\nShort game range\n\nPutting Practice green\n\nClub Fitting\n\nProShop\n\nGolf Lessons\n\nRestaurant\n\nChanging room\n\nLocker room\n\n이미지 1\n이미지 2\n이미지 3\n이미지 4\n이미지 5\n이미지 6\n이미지 7\n이미지 8\n이미지 9\n이미지 10\n이미지 11\n이미지 12\n\n## Location\n\n### Fortune Hills Country Club\n\nAddress: 34 Banwolsanseong-ro 375beon-gil, Gunnae-myeon, Pocheon-si, Gyeonggi-do\n\nPhone Number: +82 031-538-7000 [...] ## AGL Inc.\n\ninstagram\nblog\nwordpress\nlinkedin\n\n### Email Inquiry\n\nFor all general sales enquiries or post travel feedback please email\n\n## Recently Viewed Products\n\nNo recently viewed products.\n\n# TIGER BOOKING\n\nTIGER BOOKING\n언어ㆍ통화 설정\n\nAI Planner\n\n이미지 1\n이미지 2\n이미지 3\n이미지 4\n이미지 5\n이미지 6\n이미지 7\n이미지 8\n이미지 9\n이미지 10\n이미지 11\n이미지 12\n\n## Course Information\n\n### Check Points\n\nPocheon Hills Country Club is a 27-hole public golf course consisting of the Palace, Castle, and Garden courses. [...] The course names symbolize entering through the Garden, passing through the Castle gate, and finally arriving at the Palace.\n\nWith a shot value requiring the use of all 14 clubs, a championship-length course of 7,200 yards capable of hosting international tournaments, and strategic course design that cannot be conquered by power alone, it presents a fun and challenging experience where every tee shot demands careful thought and offers a new feeling each time.\n\n### Golf Course Information",
