          "url": "https://dailytong-2.tistory.com/entry/SKY72-%EA%B3%A8%ED%94%84%EC%9E%A5-%EC%98%88%EC%95%BD-%ED%99%88%ED%8E%98%EC%9D%B4%EC%A7%80-%EC%82%AC%EC%9A%A9%EB%B2%95%EA%B3%BC-%EC%98%88%EC%95%BD-%EA%B7%9C%EC%A0%95",
